<p>Property damage can turn a household or a business upside down in an afternoon. The claim that follows should help, but many Dallas property owners find it adds a second layer of stress: dense policy language, rotating adjusters, deadlines, and a first estimate that falls short of what a contractor will actually charge. As a Dallas Public Adjuster, we represent policyholders on a wide range of property insurance claims. We handle the inspection, documentation, estimating, and negotiation so you can focus on getting back to normal.</p>
