<p>Our <a href="/services/insurance-claim-supplements/">insurance claim supplements</a> service handles these situations. When the disagreement is about the amount of the loss rather than coverage, the policy's <a href="/services/insurance-appraisal/">insurance appraisal</a> clause may also be an option. Check your policy for deadlines, and talk to a Texas attorney about any deadline to file suit.</p>

<h2>How our service process works</h2>
